      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was thinking a gravity distortion/light warping effect - but that'd require a grab pass?, so not ideal for performance.\n\nI think the largest improvement would be a cubemap that you can stick your head into, being able to see the spawn point of the world you're entering.\n\n(maybe change the loading screen cubemap to the same?",
