  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I think the new portal design is really good. Where you can actually see the the world thumbnail and have the nice parallax etc etc. But they look a bit dead now compared to before. The static blue frame doesn't make it feel like you almost \"create holes in the space-time continuum\" to quote the dev update.\n\nI get that the old ripple effect might have been a bit too much for clarity. But would be nice to have some kind of movement of some sort in the edge so it feels more like you have actually opened a portal. A small wobble kind of thing.",
